          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP652 - Carl 6

N 49° 41.996 W 112° 51.011&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I FINALLY had a moment to snag this one. Managed to drive within 53 meters of the cap and walked on grass, no mud, to the cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great views, thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
