          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP652 Carl 6&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N 49° 41.996 W 112° 51.011&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was an easy stop and grab. I studied the local premises and thought about asking for a tour. Decided the scenery was pretty nice. There was  a very large piece of what I believed to be as Red Shale sitting between us and the Seniors Complex. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTBCP OFTH !!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10th of the day&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
